# Outer M22 quintet module constructions and transfer lemmas

The geometric cocode space, intrinsic fixed spaces and coordinate annihilators
are defined on the literal native ten-dimensional modules. Quotient dimensions,
equivariant duality, the implication from four-subgroup generation to the
hyperplane xi assertion, and the faithful natural-quotient centralizer deduction
are proved in the imported modules. Source assembly must still establish the
chief factors, full transvection images, local dimensions, four-subgroup
generation, natural S5 marking and native stabilizer recovery.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
H.15.4 and H.16.3, printed pp.400,403.
